|content1=
*August 31st - '''Aurora Gaming''' enter ''Counter-Strike'' with the signings of [[delus1onn]], [[KaiR0N-]], [[Lack1]], [[RAiLWAY]], [[sugaR]], [[starix]] and [[bullet (Russian player)|bullet]], with the latter two joining as coach and assistant coach, respectively. <ref name="Aurora Gaming">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1564931004866760704|title=It's finally here|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|date=2022-08-31|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
*October 11th - '''Aurora Gaming''' part ways with [[RAiLWAY]]. <ref name="-RAiLWAY">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-179073747_917|title=FREE AGENT|date=2022-10-11|author=[[RAiLWAY]]}}</ref>
*November 1st - '''Aurora Gaming''' part ways with [[sugaR]]. <ref name="-sugaR">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1587441812632993793|title=Today we bid farewell to @sugaRfromAz|date=2022-11-01|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
*November 9th - '''Aurora Gaming''' acquire [[Norwi]] from [[forZe]]. <ref name="+Norwi">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1587441812632993793|title=Today we bid farewell to @sugaRfromAz|date=2022-11-01|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
*November 22nd - '''Aurora Gaming''' transfer-list [[KaiR0N-]]. <ref name="KaiR0N- TL">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1595110342967046145|title=KaiR0N- transferred from the main CS:GO roster and put up for transfer|date=2022-11-22|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
*December 25th - '''Aurora Gaming''' acquire [[KENSi]] from [[forZe]]. <ref name="+KENSi">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1607013431873347584|title=Welcome, @KENSI_CS!|date=2022-12-25|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
*December 28th - '''Aurora Gaming''' part ways with [[delus1onn]] and acquire [[lattykk]] from [[VP.Prodigy]]. <ref name="-delus1onn +lattykk">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1608087775756300296|title=Welcome, @latt1kk!|date=2022-12-28|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>

|content2=
*January 8th - [[KaiR0N-]] is acquired by [[Virtus.pro]]. <ref name="-KaiR0N-">{{cite web|url=https://virtus.pro/en/articles/kair0n-prisoedinyaetsya-k-sostavu-virtuspro-po-csgo|title=KaiR0N- joins Virtus.pro CS:GO roster|date=2023-01-08|publisher=[[Virtus.pro]]}}</ref>
*January 9th - '''Aurora Gaming''' sign [[SELLTER]]. <ref name="+SELLTER">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1612494417570500623|title=It’s time to introduce our CS:GO lineup for this season!|date=2023-01-09|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
*May 2nd - '''Aurora Gaming''' part ways with [[starix]]. <ref name="-starix">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1653447125886173201|title=Now it's official: @starixCS is leaving Aurora|date=2023-05-02|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* June 24th - '''Aurora Gaming''' sign [[innersh1ne]] as coach. <ref name="+innersh1ne">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1672620872203378689|title=Welcome to the family @innersh1necsgo|date=2023-06-24|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* September 30th - '''Aurora Gaming''' part ways with [[innersh1ne]]. <ref name="-innersh1ne">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/innersh1necsgo/status/1708150845525606594|title=That’s it, my time in Aurora is over|date=2023-09-30|author=[[innersh1ne]]}}</ref>
* November 1st - '''Aurora Gaming''' part ways with [[bullet (Russian player)|bullet]]. <ref name="-bullet">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1719790193421566463|title=Now it's really over|date=2023-11-01|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* November 8th - '''Aurora Gaming''' bench [[lattykk]], acquire [[deko]] from [[1win]], and sign [[hooch]] as coach. <ref name="nov 2023 changes">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/37464/aurora-complete-deko-signing-name-hooch-as-head-coach|title=Aurora complete deko signing, name hooch as head coach|date=2023-11-08|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[MIRAA]]}}</ref>
* November 30th - '''Aurora Gaming''' acquire [[brain]] from [[1win]] as an assistant coach. <ref name="+brain">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1730201451022946673|date=2023-11-30|title=Stepan Sivoronov becomes the new assistant coach of our CS2 lineup!|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>

|content3=
* January 24th - '''Aurora Gaming''' bench [[SELLTER]]. <ref name="SELLTER bench">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1750201898676764915|date=2024-01-24|title=The final result at RMR could not go unnoticed by us|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* February 13th - '''Aurora Gaming''' bench [[hooch]]. <ref name="hooch bench">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1757382091887530403|date=2024-02-13|title=Dmitry hooch Bogdanov was put on the transfer list|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* February 27th - [[SELLTER]] is acquired by [[FORZE Esports]]. <ref name="-SELLTER">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1762492793291710552|date=2024-02-27|title=@selltercs moves to @forzegg|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* April 1st - '''Aurora Gaming''' promote [[brain]] from assistant coach to head coach. <ref name="brain coach">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1774798968641171559|date=2024-04-01|title=BETTER CALL STEPA|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* April 2nd - '''Aurora Gaming''' acquire [[r3salt]] from [[FORZE Esports]]. Additionally, they part ways with [[hooch]] by mutual agreement. <ref name="+r3salt">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1775131221606945254|title=We've signed @r3saltcs|date=2024-04-02|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref><ref name="-hooch">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/hoochR/status/1775132422805332372|title=We parted ways in mutual agreement with Aurora and that means I’m officially a free agent now!|date=2024-04-02|author=[[hooch]]}}</ref>
* April 5th - [[lattykk]] is acquired by [[1win]]. <ref name="-lattykk">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/1winesports/status/1776234331498762414|title=The jokes are over|date=2024-04-05|author=[[1win]]}}</ref>
* August 17th - '''Aurora Gaming''' replace [[r3salt]] with [[clax]] in a swap deal with [[9Pandas]]. <ref name="+clax">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1824763139117789315|title=Welcome to Aurora, @claxcs2!|date=2024-08-17|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* September 13th - '''Aurora Gaming''' acquire [[XomA]] from [[Virtus.pro]] as an assistant coach. <ref name="+xoma">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/TheAurora_GG/status/1834487822964982257|title=AURORA: +XOMA|date=2024-09-13|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* November 28th - [[deko]] steps down from the active lineup and takes a break from competitive ''Counter-Strike''. <ref name="deko inactive">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/1862089079858360757|title=deko is taking a break in the competitive career|date=2024-11-28|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* December 5th - '''Aurora Gaming''' bench [[Lack1]] and swap [[brain]] and [[XomA]]'s roles as coach and assistant coach. <ref name="lack1 bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/1864611214321393925|title=Lack1 moves to an inactive position and is now open for new opportunities|date=2024-12-05|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref><ref name="swap coach">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/auroracs2_gg/status/1864686369403977799|title=Xoma becomes the head coach of Aurora|date=2024-12-05|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* December 29th - '''Aurora Gaming''' promote [[gr1ks]] from the [[Aurora Young Blud|academy team]]. <ref name="+gr1ks">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/1873398760174456873|title=Welcome, gr1ks|date=2024-12-29|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* December 31st - '''Aurora Gaming''' acquire [[Patsi]] from [[PARIVISION]]. <ref name="+patsi">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/auroracs2_gg/status/1874093266578399626|date=2024-12-31|title=Patsi joins Aurora Family|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>

|content4=
* January 5th - '''Aurora Gaming''' part ways with [[brain]]. <ref name="-brain">{{inside source|source=Lk-}}</ref>
* February 20th - [[Lack1]] is acquired by [[GUN5 Esports]]. <ref name="-Lack1">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/1892553018253427079|date=2025-02-20|title=Lack1 moves to GUN5|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* March 1st - '''Aurora Gaming''' sign [[StRoGo]]. <ref name="+strogo">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/1895868181056790748|date=2025-03-01|title=Jokes are over|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* April 5th - '''Aurora Gaming''' bench their roster and acquire the roster of [[Eternal Fire]], consisting of [[XANTARES]], [[MAJ3R]], [[Wicadia]], [[woxic]], [[jottAAA]], and [[Fabre]], the latter as coach. <ref name="disband 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/1908433642235240892|date=2025-04-05|title=Regarding Aurora CS2 roster|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref><ref name="roster 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/1908459555857514667|date=2025-04-05|title=Today we are happy to announce the beginning of a new milestone|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* May 1st - [[Norwi]], [[KENSi]], [[clax]], [[gr1ks]], [[Patsi]], and [[XomA]] are acquired by [[Astrum]]. <ref name="-ru roster">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/astrumcs2/5|date=2025-05-01|title=Astrum врывается в Counter-Strike 2 с мощным составом!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Astrum breaks into Counter-Strike 2 with a powerful lineup!|author=[[Astrum]]}}</ref>
* July 12th - '''Aurora Gaming''' sign [[gAndhi]] as an analyst. <ref name="+gandhi snagito">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/1943928468615413956|date=2025-07-12|title=Ready for us when we needed them most|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* December 23rd - '''Aurora Gaming''' sign [[forg1]] as a content creator. <ref name="+forg1">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraGaming_GG/status/2003526841454461361|date=2025-12-23|title=Did someone say ribbit?|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* December 27th - '''Aurora Gaming''' bench [[jottAAA]] by mutual agreement and acquire [[soulfly]] from [[Fire Flux Esports]] as his replacement. <ref name="bench jottAAA">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/2004959230143484148|date=2025-12-27|title=jottAAA steps down from the active roster|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref><ref name="+soulfly">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/2004960481543586018|date=2025-12-27|title=Fresh blood is here|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>

|content5=
* February 2nd - [[jottAAA]] is loaned to [[Eternal Fire]]. <ref name="jottAAA loan">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/2018406602840134037|date=2026-02-02|title=Official: @jotta_cs joins @eternalfiregg on loan|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* June 29th - '''Aurora Gaming''' bench [[Fabre]]. <ref name="Fabre bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/2071594558119354536|date=2026-06-29|title=Today, we have to say goodbye to Fabre|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* July 2nd - '''Aurora Gaming''' bench [[MAJ3R]] and [[soulfly]]. <ref name="MAJ3R bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/2072711910986785195|date=2026-07-02|title=TEŞEKKÜRLER MAJ3R!|language={{Flag|tr}} Turkish|trans_title=THANK YOU MAJ3R!|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref><ref name="soulfly bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/i/status/2072727019943608487|date=2026-07-02|title=Today, soulfly has been moved to the bench at Aurora Gaming|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* July 3rd - '''Aurora Gaming''' sign [[Jimpphat]] and [[ashhh]], the latter as the team's coach. <ref name="+Jimpphat">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/2073104510189228086|title=Welcome to Aurora, Jimpphat|date=2026-07-03|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref><ref name="+ashhh">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/2073089404143271946|title=Ashley “ash” Battye is the new coach|date=2026-07-03|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* July 8th - '''Aurora Gaming''' acquire [[kyxsan]] from [[Team Falcons]] to complete their roster. <ref name="+kyxsan">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/2074841104046825746|title=Welcome, kyxsan!|date=2026-07-08|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* August 23rd - [[jottAAA]] and [[soulfly]] are acquired by [[Eternal Fire]], the former on a permanent basis. <ref name="-jottAAA -soulfly">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraCS2_GG/status/2091529732651135128|title=Oyuncularımız @jotta_cs ve @soulflycs, Eternal Fire'a transfer olmuştur|trans_title=Our players @jotta_cs and @soulflycs have transferred to Eternal Fire|language={{Flag|tr}} Turkish|date=2026-08-23|author='''Aurora Gaming'''}}</ref>
* September 11th - [[Fabre]] is acquired by [[Eternal Fire]]. <ref name="-Fabre">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/eternalfiregg/status/2098466659354718276|title=Bu ev senin evin, bu aile senin ailen|trans_title=This is your home, this is your family|language={{Flag|tr}} Turkish|date=2026-09-11|author=[[Eternal Fire]]}}</ref>
}}

