'''Legacy''' (briefly known as '''Fake Natty''') is a [[:Category:Brazil|Brazilian]] professional esports organization founded in 2023 when [[00 Nation]]'s Brazilian division split from the company.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2023
|name2=2024
|name3=2025
|name4=2026
|This=4

|content1=
* August 15th - '''Fake Natty''' is formed with the separation of [[00 Nation]]'s Brazilian division, taking the Brazilian lineup and staff with them. <ref name="fake natty">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ZeroZeroBRASIL/status/1691469037044465664|title=NOVIDADES EM BREVE|trans_title=NEWS COMING SOON|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2023-08-15|author=[[00 Nation]]}}</ref>
* August 17th - '''Fake Natty''' transfer [[b4rtiN]] from their [[:valorant:00_Nation|''VALORANT'' division]] onto the team as an inactive player. <ref name="+b4rtiN">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/b4rtiNfps/status/1692204800442618132|title=Salve, Galera! Venho informar que com o fim da @ZeroZeroBRASIL, estou aberto à propostas de CS|trans_title=Hail, Guys! I come to inform you that with the end of @ZeroZeroBRASIL, I am open to CS proposals|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2023-08-17|author=[[b4rtiN]]}}</ref>
* September 22nd - '''Fake Natty'''<nowiki>'s</nowiki> new name is revealed as '''Legacy'''. <ref>{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/legacyggbr/status/1705228689376415977|title=CHEGAMOS!|trans_title=WE ARRIVED!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2023-09-22|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
* September 26th - '''Legacy''' release [[TACO]]. <ref name="-TACO">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/TACOCS/status/1706777099908923450|title=After some time off, I’m here to announce that I’m ready to my return!|date=2023-09-26|author=[[TACO]]}}</ref>
* October 16th - '''Legacy''' loan [[b4rtiN]] to [[RED Canids]]. <ref name="b4rtiN loan">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/REDCanids/status/1714024729537904912|title=A bala vai voltar a voar, matilha!|trans_title=The bullet will fly again, pack!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2023-10-16|author=[[RED Canids]]}}</ref>
* October 25th - '''Legacy''' bench [[nqz]] and recall [[b4rtiN]] from [[RED Canids]] as his replacement. <ref name="nqz bench">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/legacyggbr/status/1717278814319841593|title=Hoje viemos anunciar que o @nqzcs foi movido ao banco de reservas|trans_title=Today we came to announce that @nqzcs has been moved to the reserve bench|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2023-10-25|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref><ref name="b4rtiN back">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/legacyggbr/status/1717338300980072614|date=2023-10-25|title=Ele voltou pra fechar o trio|trans_title=He came back to close the trio|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
* November 11th - [[nqz]] is acquired by [[paiN Gaming]]. <ref name="-nqz">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/paiNGamingBR/status/1723354931946492037|title=COLA NÓIS @nqzcs E @n1ssimV!|trans_title=GLUE US @nqzcs AND @n1ssimV!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2023-11-11|author=[[paiN Gaming]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* March 25th - '''Legacy''' bench [[coldzera]] by mutual agreement. <ref name="coldzera bench">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/legacyggbr/status/1772256044900569155|title=Hoje anunciamos que o @coldzera foi movido ao banco de reservas em comum acordo|trans_title=Today we announce that @coldzera has been moved to the reserve bench by mutual agreement|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-03-25|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
* March 29th - '''Legacy''' add [[Stewie2K]] as a stand-in. <ref name="+Stewie2K">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/legacyggbr/status/1773870164615770583|title=Coé @Stewie!|trans_title=Yo @Stewie!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-03-29|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
* April 18th - '''Legacy''' release [[coldzera]]. <ref name="-coldzera">{{cite_web|url=https://twitter.com/coldzera/status/1781115343483568508|title=Gostaria de comunicar a todos que n integro mais a organização Legacy|trans_title=I would like to inform everyone that I am no longer part of the Legacy organization|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-04-18|author=[[coldzera]]}}</ref>
* April 30th - '''Legacy''' release [[n9xtz]] upon the end of his loan to [[Arena Jogue Fácil Esports]]. <ref name="-n9xtz">{{inside source|date=2024-05-28|source=n9xtz}}</ref>
* May 31st - '''Legacy''' part ways with [[Stewie2K]] as they acquire [[saadzin]] from [[w7m esports]]. <ref name="+saadzin">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/w7mesports/status/1796626881648746735|title=Hoje nos despedimos oficialmente do nosso player de CS2 @saadzin_fps, que agora partirá para um novo rumo em sua carreira|trans_title=Today we officially say goodbye to our CS2 player @saadzin_fps, who will now embark on a new path in his career|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-05-31|author=[[w7m esports]]}}</ref>
* November 23rd - '''Legacy''' bench [[b4rtiN]]. <ref name="bench b4rtin">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/legacyggbr/status/1860382870935601301|title=Informamos que o jogador @b4rtiNfps foi movido ao banco da nossa equipe de CS|trans_title=Please note that the player @b4rtiNfps has been moved to our CS team bench|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-11-23|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
* December 26th - '''Legacy''' bench [[NEKIZ]]. <ref name="bench NEKIZ">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/legacyggbr/status/1872386939976085972|title=Informamos que o jogador @nekizcs foi movido ao banco da nossa equipe|trans_title=We inform you that the player @nekizcs has been moved to our team's bench|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2024-12-26|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>

|content3=
* January 2nd - '''Legacy''' sign [[n1ssim]]. <ref name="+n1ssim">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/legacyggbr/status/1874931767091794082|title=Foi um pouco mais que 3 minutos, mas a espera valeu a pena!|trans_title=It was a little over 3 minutes, but the wait was worth it!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-01-02|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
* January 3rd - '''Legacy''' acquire [[lux]] from [[paiN Gaming]]. <ref name="+lux">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/legacyggbr/status/1875286016548077726|title=Sempre é um bom momento para presentear pessoas queridas!|trans_title=It's always a good time to give gifts to loved ones!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-01-03|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
*July 2nd - '''Legacy''' release [[NEKIZ]] and [[b4rtiN]]. <ref name="-NEKIZ">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/nekizcs/status/1940434637144412391|title=Hoje informo que estou F/A e livre pra negociar com qualquer equipe|trans_title=Today I announce that I am F/A and free to negotiate with any team|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-07-02|author=[[NEKIZ]]}}</ref><ref name="-b4rtin">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/b4rtiNfps/status/1940444478491296006|title=Hoje se encerra meu vínculo com a @legacyggbr e estou free agent|trans_title=Today my contract with @legacyggbr ends and I am a free agent|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-07-02|author=[[b4rtiN]]}}</ref>
*December 19th - '''Legacy''' part ways with [[chucky]]. <ref name="-chucky">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/legacyggbr/status/2002081444391170155|title=Obrigado por tudo, @OLAchucky|trans_title=Thanks for everything, @OLAchucky|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2025-12-19|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>

|content4=
* January 12th - '''Legacy''' sign [[RiVAS]] as their new coach. <ref name="+RivaS">{{cite_web|url=https://x.com/legacyggbr/status/2010849494921830458|title=E o responsável por comandar a equipe nessa nova etapa será o @rivetti_lgy|trans_title=And the person responsible for leading the team in this new phase will be @rivetti_lgy|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-01-12|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
* February 2nd - '''Legacy''' bench [[lux]]. <ref name="bench lux">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/legacyggbr/status/2018358848860401789|title=Informamos que o jogador LUX foi movido ao banco de reservas da nossa equipe|trans_title=We would like to inform you that player LUX has been moved to the reserve bench for our team|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-02-02|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
* February 3rd - '''Legacy''' acquire [[arT]] from [[Fluxo W7M]]. <ref name="+arT">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/legacyggbr/status/2018778533930078290|title=O @arTcsgo é nosso novo IGL!|trans_title=@arTcsgo is our new IGL!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-02-03|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
* April 22nd - [[RiVAS]] steps down from the active lineup while [[adr]] takes over as interim coach. <ref name="adr int-c">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/legacyggbr/status/2046975092144419084|title=Informamos que o treinador RIVAS não estará à frente da equipe nos próximos campeonatos|trans_title=We inform you that coach RIVAS will not be leading the team in the upcoming championships|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-04-22|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
* May 4th - '''Legacy''' acquire [[bobz]] on loan from [[Yawara E-Sports]] as an analyst until the end of the [[Intel_Extreme_Masters/2026/Cologne|IEM Cologne 2026 Major]]. <ref name="bobz loan">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/legacyggbr/status/2051408837756719367|title=E TEM REFORÇO CHEGANDO!|trans_title=AND WE HAVE REINFORCEMENT ARRIVING!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-05-04|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
* June 15th - '''Legacy''' bench [[n1ssim]] by mutual agreement. <ref name="bench n1ssim">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/legacyggbr/status/2066626604655120823|title=Informamos que o nosso atleta @n1ssimV pediu para ir para o banco da nossa equipe de CS|trans_title=We would like to inform you that our athlete @n1ssimV has requested to be benched for our CS team|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2026-06-15|author='''Legacy'''}}</ref>
